{
  "id": "2TH.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "2TH",
  "reference": "Tesalonikek 2 2",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2TH 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng’alek che ma bo iman agobo nyonunetab Kiptaiyat",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisomok anyun, che kitupche, agobo nyonunetab Kiptaiyandennyo Jesu Kristo, ak kayumennyo bo ge ne kiyumjinige inendet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si motoptobense ochokyi eng’ kabwatutikwok, anan oarogense, ngot ko eng’ tamirmiriet, anan eng’ ng’olyo, anan eng’ baruet ne olen bunwech, olen kagoit betutab Kiptaiyat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amat kong’alak chi eng’ kiy age tugul; amu maitu betunoto, kobate indou katuituet ak keng’any chito ne bo tengekto, weritab luset, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inendet ne kirindoi ak kotororegei kogirindoi tugul che kiguure Jehovah anan che kilosu; si koteb anyun eng’ hekalutab Jehovah, koborugei inendet ko u ne Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tos mobwati, yu kiami kobotok, ole kiamwawok tuguchu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nguno ongen noto ne ranyei, si kobiit keng’any eng’ betusiekyik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu boisiei nguno ung’otietab ngelelnatet; kobate mi agenge ne ranyei nguno, agoi keisto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak yeityo keng’any ngeleliot, ne tun barei Kiptaiyat Jesu eng’ kabusetab kutinnyi, ak kong’em koek buch eng’ ng’ang’etab nyonunennyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyonunennyi konamegei ak boisietab Setani koboto kamuget tugul ak kaborunoik ak kwong’utik che bo lembech, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koboto kenisiet tugul che ma bo imanda agobo ichek che lustos; amu ma taach chamnyetab imanit, si kobiit kesor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu nito anyun, iyokyin Jehovah ichek kamaaset ne boisie si kobiit koyan lembeita: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si kobiit kiruokyi ichek tugul che ma iyan imanit, ago che kiboiboitune che ma bo imanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kongoi kogeny ak saet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kanyol kemwachi Jehovah kongoi kotugul agobo okwek, che kitupche che chamanikab Kiptaiyat, amu kilewenjok Jehovah yetunet koboch taunet eng’ katabanetab Tamirmiriet ak kayanetab imanit: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kiguurok anyun eng’ choto eng’ logoiywekyok che miach, si kobiit onyoru torornatetab Kiptaiyandennyo Jesu Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noto anyun, che kitupche, olumdege, ak onam bitonwek che kiginetak, ngot ko eng’ ng’olyot, anan eng’ baruennyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno anyun, ingogaigai Kiptaiyandennyo Jesu Kristo, ak Jehovah Kwandanyo ne kichamech ak kogonech kagaigaet ne bo koigeny ak kamang’unet ne mie eng’ mieindo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kogaigai mugulelwekwok ak kogimit ichek eng’ boisiet age tugul ne mie ak ng’olyot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
